    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SWF-01 Backend Call (classified retry + backoff)\nThe only place that knows the backend URL and API key.\n- 2xx: return the result.\n- `retryable: true`, 429, 408, 5xx or a network error: retry after 2s, then 4s (3 attempts maximum). Each retry is logged as RETRY_ATTEMPT, and a success after a retry as RETRY_RECOVERED.\n- Any other 4xx: no retry.\nIt never throws. The caller gets `{ ok, status, body, attempts, error_class, error_code, error_message }` and decides between a fallback and the error queue (SWF-03).\n`X-Attempt` and `X-Fault-Inject` drive the deterministic failure demos.",
        "color": 5
      },
